From 839faba5089bc88f367bfec1774fe1b7011a6626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 19:34:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(registry): add timeline component

Add a Timeline PDF component for both the takumi and forme bases: a
vertical accent spine with dot markers, a fixed-width muted date column,
a semibold title and optional muted body.

Each item is rendered as its own unbreakable row (wrap={false}) with its
own spine segment and dot, so the spine and dots stay aligned across
items of different heights and long timelines split across pages
without orphaned markers.

Includes docs pages with live previews, examples, registry.json entries
and the regenerated public registry output.

Closes #75

Signed-off-by: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
