+## Usage
+
+```tsx
+import { Timeline } from "@/components/pdf/timeline";
+```
+
+```tsx
+<Timeline
+  items={[
+    {
+      date: "2021 – 2024",
+      title: "Senior Engineer",
+      body: "Led the billing platform team.",
+    },
+    { date: "2018 – 2021", title: "Software Engineer" },
+  ]}
+/>
+```
+
+Each item is rendered as its own unbreakable row with its own spine segment and dot, so long timelines (resume experience, event schedules, proposal phases) split across pages without orphaned markers.
